actual_result: "Full release gate 158/159, zero skips, 100 lines/branches/functions across 16 configured files; statements unmeasured. Existing replace assertion blocked by independently reproduced upstream pm-cli#1394, package owner pm-yatu. Both audits clean; strict health exit0 with one advisory. All remaining release steps pass. Packed real tracker npm/native Bun catalog/show/diff/validate/export and all seven merge/replace applications pass; scratch removed. GitHub preview zero cases, no issue writes or scheduling. CI/reviews pending."
