comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-04T11:54:54.797Z",codex-sol,Certification worktree based on origin/main 050df6c. No open 2026.10 certification exists; pm-weky owns blocked version-specific 2026.9.28 evidence. Consolidate Dependabot #111 #112 #114 #115 and exact published pins. Security alerts zero; SDK floor stays 2026.9.30. Full audit measured separately; preserve 100% line/branch/function thresholds and report statements as unmeasured.
  "2026-10-04T12:00:15.093Z",codex-sol,"Both production and full npm audits are clean: zero vulnerabilities; pm-ops 2026.10.4 has no fast-glob dependency. Removed my uncommitted provisional audit finding after measuring the actual graph. Initial full gate: 158/159 tests pass, zero skips, 100% lines/branches/functions; replace-mode SDK mutation preserves an omitted governance leftover key. Preserve the assertion and investigate audited API semantics."
  "2026-10-04T12:05:26.879Z",codex-sol,"Independent disposable SDK-only reproduction confirmed complete-next-tree mutation cannot remove unknown owned-subtree keys: callback and preview omit the key, persistence retains true. Searched duplicates, filed upstream pm-cli#1394; no upstream source edits. Preserve replace assertion and audit lock/history boundary; certification NOT READY while upstream capability is blocked."
  "2026-10-04T12:10:16.978Z",codex-sol,"Real-tracker tarball npm and native Bun acceptance passed: list/validate/show/diff/dry-run apply/export plus all seven presets in merge and replace modes; catalog equality and exported JSON parsed. Scratch deleted. Remaining independent release steps pass, audits clean, health strict exit0. Preserve blocked SDK replacement assertion; docs include exact receipts. CI restores managed pm-github artifacts before health."
  "2026-10-04T12:21:07.824Z",codex-sol,Certification implementation and packed acceptance committed; item remains in_progress for orchestrator verification. Releasing ownership while consolidated PR waits for dependency/upstream and review gates. No item closed.
